<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Expected-Value Radar — which pre-token protocol is worth farming next</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="radar-ring" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sweep"></span><span class="blip b1"></span><span class="blip b2"></span><span class="blip b3"></span></div>
  <div class="mast-text">
    <p class="kicker">TOKEN LAUNCH RADAR &middot; EXPECTED-VALUE EDITION</p>
    <h1>Farm the launch before it exists.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Every protocol below records no token yet. Each one is priced as an
    <strong>expected value</strong> — what its token would be worth, times the odds it ever
    launches — so the top of the board is the farm worth your week, not the biggest TVL.</p>
    <p class="meta" id="metaLine">Loading the sealed snapshot&hellip;</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="stats" id="stats" aria-label="Board totals"></section>

<section class="week" aria-label="Farm this week">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Farm this week</h2>
    <p>The five highest-conviction farms. Start at the top, work down, one wallet, one week each.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="week-cards" id="weekCards"></div>
</section>

<main>
  <section class="board" aria-label="Ranked board">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>The board — all <span id="rowCount">&hellip;</span> pre-token protocols</h2>
      <p>Click any row for the full model breakdown and the farm plan. Implied value is the
      entry&rsquo;s own claim, never a promise the token launches.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <label>Search <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="name or slug&hellip;" autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label>Category
        <select id="cat"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>Show
        <select id="show">
          <option value="all">All pre-token</option>
          <option value="watchlist">Watchlist only (40)</option>
          <option value="farm">FARM NOW + FARM</option>
          <option value="pass">PASS — already a product</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Sort by
        <select id="sort">
          <option value="implied">Implied value</option>
          <option value="prob">Launch probability</option>
          <option value="tvl">TVL</option>
          <option value="growth">7-day growth</option>
          <option value="age">Newest first</option>
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table id="boardTable">
        <thead><tr>
          <th class="num">#</th><th>Protocol</th><th class="num">TVL</th><th class="num">7d</th>
          <th class="num">Peer &times;</th><th class="num">Launch %</th><th class="num">Implied value</th><th>Verdict</th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="count-line" id="countLine"></p>
  </section>

  <section class="detail" id="detail" aria-label="Protocol detail" hidden>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="detailTitle">Protocol detail</h2>
